<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Western Gas Resources cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Western Gas Resources cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Yves Siegel has cut his rating for Western Gas Resources Inc to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Denver natural gas company closed at 19-3/8 on Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
